#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0413 expect=noViolation domain=DM
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when the Domain Abbreviation (DOMAIN) value is not consistent with the name of the dataset (the dataset name does not begin with the DOMAIN value).
#note "Dataset name DM begins with the DOMAIN value DM, so the rule does not fire"
dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1023
---
